      "originalText": "apps/downloader/main.py\n\ndownload_youtube_video()  — POST endpoint, bearer-auth\ndownload_youtube_video_worker()  — tries ranked free proxies, uploads winner to S3\nrefresh_proxies()  — Modal scheduled fn, every 15 min, speed-tests\n  yt-dlp-proxy's free proxy list, writes top 5 to Volume \"clipcast-proxies\"\nYT_DLP_PROXY env — optional paid residential-proxy override",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
